{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54083","headline":"送李羣玉 · 卢肇","name":"送李羣玉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君梦涔阳月，中秋忆[棹歌]（归棹）。\n铅黄辞秘府，诗酒寄沧波。\n妙吹应谐凤，工书定得鹅。\n[□□□□□，□□□□□。\n]（详附按）（按：此诗诗题及前四句，出宋王象之《舆地纪胜》卷七十。\n「归棹」二字不韵，从《全唐诗》卷五五一引《岳州府志》改。\n「妙吹」二句，出宋钱易《南部新书》卷乙。\n详诗意及押韵，与前四句应爲一首。\n原诗应爲五律，末二句缺。\n「君梦」、「妙吹」二联，《全唐诗》已收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}